  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A conducting metal rod of length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\"></span> cm is moving through a uniform magnetic field at constant speed. The direction of the field is out of the page and the magnetic field strength is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\"></span> mT. The induced emf in the rod is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.5\"></span> mV.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the distance travelled by the rod during one minute?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.60\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.2\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12\"></span> m</li>\n</ol>"
  },
